// Measurements wave, packages M1 to M4: the garment aware studio
// for suits, jackets, trousers, waistcoats and shirts, for Men,
// Women and Boys alike. When a measuring session carries one of
// those garments, the studio collects the verified per garment
// set from lib/measurement-schema.js (the same definitions both
// server validators use), in the benchmark order, under the
// chosen wearer's rules (for Women every field is required; Boys
// use the child ranges), and saves a version 2 profile. Trousers
// and waistcoats also take their ready (standard size) flow here
// for Men, garment shaped with the trousers inseam choice; Women
// and Boys take their ready flow here for every studio garment,
